<title>POLAND: RAFAKO JULY LOSS WIDENS TO PLN 1.86 MLN.</title>
<headline>RAFAKO JULY LOSS WIDENS TO PLN 1.86 MLN.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-08-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Preliminary results July</p>
<p>(in million zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p> JULY		     1997     1996</p>
<p> Net loss		 1.86 vs   1.31</p>
<p> Pre-tax loss	   1.86 vs   1.31</p>
<p> Operating loss	 0.73 vs   1.78 profit</p>
<p> Sales		   12.73 vs  30.28</p>
<p> JANUARY-JULY	   1997     1996</p>
<p> Net loss		13.53 vs   3.75 profit</p>
<p> Pre-tax loss	  13.53 vs   3.75 profit</p>
<p> Operating profit     9.37 vs  15.15</p>
<p> Sales		  165.38 vs 226.89</p>
<p>Note. Full name of the Polish industrial boiler maker is</p>
<p>Rafako SA.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
